{"unit_id": "yutingzhao1991__dsh-review#card-zh", "repo": "yutingzhao1991/dsh-review", "commit": "5aa0bb54cc31f11539d29b78bd0212e88549f1ab", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-review**（DSH 网页插件）：为 DSH 智能体提供通用代码评审工具。它将评审任务并行交给配置好的 CLI 编码智能体或 DSH 子智能体，并汇总为一份报告；可选择未提交改动、分支差异或指定提交，设置评审模式与关注指令，并通过后台 job 返回长任务结果。网页界面还显示每轮评审状态和历史记录，也可在 GUI 中配置评审者。适合希望在 DSH 会话中调用一个或多个编码智能体检查改动的用户；需要配置可用的 CLI 或 DSH 子智能体。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:55", "index.js:105", "index.js:151"]}
{"unit_id": "yutingzhao1991__dsh-review#card-en", "repo": "yutingzhao1991/dsh-review", "commit": "5aa0bb54cc31f11539d29b78bd0212e88549f1ab", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "**dsh-review** (DSH web plugin) gives DSH agents a code review tool. It runs configured CLI reviewers or subagents in parallel and combines findings. Review uncommitted changes, a branch range, or a commit; select a mode and track long runs as background jobs. Requires configured reviewers.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:55", "index.js:105", "index.js:151"]}
