{"unit_id": "yutingzhao1991__dsh-review#feature-1", "repo": "yutingzhao1991/dsh-review", "commit": "5aa0bb54cc31f11539d29b78bd0212e88549f1ab", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-review** 的功能「多评审者代码审查」：可并行调用配置好的 CLI 编码智能体或 DSH 子智能体评审代码改动，并把各评审者的结论汇总成一份报告。通过 review 工具选择评审者和评审模式。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:105", "index.js:109"]}
{"unit_id": "yutingzhao1991__dsh-review#feature-2", "repo": "yutingzhao1991/dsh-review", "commit": "5aa0bb54cc31f11539d29b78bd0212e88549f1ab", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-review** 的功能「选择评审范围」：可评审工作区未提交改动、相对分支的改动或指定提交引入的改动；base 与 commit 不能同时提供。通过 review 工具传入对应参数。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:140", "index.js:170", "index.js:171"]}
{"unit_id": "yutingzhao1991__dsh-review#feature-3", "repo": "yutingzhao1991/dsh-review", "commit": "5aa0bb54cc31f11539d29b78bd0212e88549f1ab", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-review** 的功能「后台评审任务」：评审耗时较长时可立即返回 job id，任务完成后自动通知；调用方可通过 job_output 查看结果或用 job_kill 终止。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:145", "index.js:18"]}
{"unit_id": "yutingzhao1991__dsh-review#feature-4", "repo": "yutingzhao1991/dsh-review", "commit": "5aa0bb54cc31f11539d29b78bd0212e88549f1ab", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-review** 的功能「网页评审状态与历史」：在对话和输入框之间显示评审状态，并可展开查看评审轮次、范围与结果；状态随会话保存。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client/client.js:2732", "index.js:51"]}
{"unit_id": "yutingzhao1991__dsh-review#feature-5", "repo": "yutingzhao1991/dsh-review", "commit": "5aa0bb54cc31f11539d29b78bd0212e88549f1ab", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-review** 的功能「图形化配置评审者」：当配置表单依赖可用时，可在网页 GUI 配置评审者和评审模式，并自动保存修改。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:39", "client/client.js:2716"]}
